# Combat

## Bow ([`src/combat/bow.js`](src/combat/bow.js))

- Authored `bow.glb` on LeftHand world socket after `avatar.prepareSkeleton()`.
- Look = camera `getLookDir` (crosshair). Equip on first shot; visible while `_busy === 'draw'`.
- **Aim parallax (OTS):** do not fire parallel to look from an offset muzzle. `releaseShot(lookDir, cameraPos)` aims at a point on the look ray ~`AIM_AHEAD` past the muzzle’s depth along that ray, then fires `normalize(aimPoint − muzzle)`.
- Wire `avatar.getCameraPos` from the camera rig. Bow SFX volume modest (~0.28).

## Arrows ([`src/combat/arrows.js`](src/combat/arrows.js))

- Pool of **10** `arrow.glb` instances — visible in flight, stuck on impact (FIFO recycle).
- Tip authored −Z → apply `_tipFix` (π yaw). Plant mid-shaft so tip penetrates ~`PENETRATE`.
- Giant plant: snap to `GIANT_BODY_R`, then **`attachToBone`** nearest body bone (not root) so shafts ride attacks.
- Pillar plant: detect with `hitRadius`, plant at tighter `surfaceRadius` (embed into shaft); parent to pillar root; play `arrow_impact_pillar.mp3`.
- Ground plant: world-space stuck in sand. Giant impact SFX only on giant hits.

## SFX ([`src/combat/sfx.js`](src/combat/sfx.js))

- `preloadSfx` / `playSfx` / `unlockAudio` — Web Audio buffer pool, HTMLAudio fallback.
- Trim leading silence from one-shots so impact timing matches ballistics / melee window.
